This directory contains a vendored subset of the "dbis-functional-dependencies"
package, version 1.0.4, distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Upstream project: dbis-functional-dependencies
  Version:          1.0.4
  License:          Apache License, Version 2.0 (see the LICENSE file here)
  Source:           https://pypi.org/project/dbis-functional-dependencies/
  Original author:  see the module headers (BCNF.py credits maxwellgerber)

Vendored modules:
  - BCNF.py     (functional dependency set, closure, candidate keys, normal
                 form tests, synthesis and decomposition)
  - fdsbase.py  (supporting Attribute / Set / Notation / FD primitives)

Local modifications:
  - BCNF.py: the import of "fdsbase" was changed from an absolute import
    ("from dbis_functional_dependencies.fdsbase import ...") to a relative
    import ("from .fdsbase import ...") so the subset works as a standalone
    package. No functional logic was altered.

The remaining upstream modules (fds.py, fdcheck.py) and the upstream package
metadata (which declared sphinx, build, networkx, and graphviz as runtime
dependencies) were intentionally not vendored, as the functional-dependency
logic does not require them.
